{"sym":"NVPT.TA","v":2,"about":{"summary":"Navitas Petroleum, Limited Partnership, an independent oil and gas partnership, engages in the exploration, development, and production of oil and gas. Its asset portfolio includes Shenandoah, Buckskin, Monument, and Shenandoah South in the waters of the Gulf of America south of the coast of Texas and Louisiana and in onshore oil fields in Texas; and Gas and Oil Assets in the Northern Southwest Atlantic Ocean. The company also has rights to an offshore exploration license in the Philippines and an option to join as a partner in another offshore oil asset located off the coast of Morocco. Navitas Petroleum, Limited Partnership was founded in 2013 and is headquartered in Herzliya, Israel.","lead":"Navitas Petroleum, Limited Partnership, an independent oil and gas partnership, engages in the exploration, development, and production of oil and gas.","web":"https://navitaspet.com","emp":59,"city":"Herzliya","country":"Israel"},"officers":[{"n":"Mr. Amit Kornhauser CPA","t":"CEO & Director of Fleur Oil and Gas Management Ltd","age":49,"yb":1976,"pay":994000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Ian Ramsay","t":"Chief Executive Officer of Navitas Petroleum Development and Production Limited","age":55,"yb":1970,"pay":2886000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Jonathan Sternberg","t":"Chief Executive Officer of Navits USA - Fleur Oil and Gas Management Ltd","age":37,"yb":1988,"pay":962000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Tamar Rosenberg","t":"Chief Financial Officer","age":47,"yb":1978,"fy":2025},{"n":"Dr. Nadav Sorek","t":"Vice President Subsurface & Operations","age":43,"yb":1982,"fy":2025},{"n":"Sergei Lissotchenko","t":"Accounting Manager","fy":2025},{"n":"Reut Kosovezer Shumi","t":"Office Administrator & HR Manager","fy":2025},{"n":"Ms. Meital Hillel Abramov","t":"VP & General Counsel","age":42,"yb":1983,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. David Bernheim","t":"Chief Commercial and M&A Officer","age":55,"yb":1970,"pay":460000,"fy":2025},{"n":"Mr. Larry Adamson","t":"Vice President of E